- `frontend/src/components/AddTask.jsx` — added a `priority-select` (`Low`/`Normal`/`High`), defaulting to and resetting to `normal` after submit; `onAdd` now passes `(trimmed, priority)`.
- `frontend/src/components/TaskList.jsx` — `TaskRow`'s view-mode row got a `priority-select` (independent of title-edit mode), threaded via a new `onPriorityChange` prop through `TaskList`.
- `frontend/src/App.jsx` — added `sortedTasks`, a stable partition (`high` first) applied *after* the existing `visibleTasks` filter; `<TaskList>` now receives `sortedTasks` and a new `onPriorityChange` handler wired through the existing `run()`/`refresh()` pattern (no optimistic update, no new state machinery).
- `frontend/src/App.css` — `.priority-select` base style plus `.priority-high` (orange fill/white text) and `.priority-low` (light gray) modifiers; `.priority-normal` intentionally has no override.

